# The wide frame: a passage of a message picked and quoted, what is said about it typed in its line, sent with no other
# words: its card flies from the composer to its place in the message, its words setting out from where they were, its
# ground from the composer's card's width and colour to its own (sfpages composer.mbt flying_quotes). MBUI_WIN=1280x800.
timeout 20000
until 发消息
wait 600
dragon 120 0 400 推送截图前要先登录 gh。
wait 400
tap 引用
wait 600
type 这一步写进文档
enter
wait 600
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 1500
exit
